"The Anesidoran High Council has an elected President and helps make the island's laws."
"Aulia Velra ran for its President a few years back and did not come close to winning."
"The Anesidoran government takes a share of Post Drop Nice List fees."
"It sits in a trapezoid capitol of glass and black stone, with class representatives' offices."
"Each class has a representative, who has little power unless elected President."
"Avowed become legal voters on Anesidora the moment they set foot there."
"The Unified Rares and Uniques seat speaks for ultra-rare and unique classes too small for their own."
"All council members at the time of the Matadero attack knew Aulia Velra kept a Submerger."
"After the attack it negotiated with the Triplanets and the System for more teleportation."
"Aulia Velra proposed a public tattooing to bind councilors to their oaths; they united against it."
